        {
          "handle": "dnystedt",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Rumor: Nvidia Vera Rubin-based servers face delay due to lack of enough HBM4 memory chips, pushing the volume ramp to 1st half 2027 from year-end originally, media report, adding the delay will impact 800V DC power suppliers, M9 substrate materials makers and optical parts makers",
