          "timestamp": "2026-11-16T07:36:50.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 76
        },
        {
          "handle": "ctee.fans",
          "platform": "Facebook",
          "text": "記憶體廠第3季財報陸續出爐，南亞科等3家獲利皆再創新高，模組廠獲利表現出現不同調局面，業者認為記憶體市況將趨於分歧，明年上半年DRAM供給恐將更缺，部分廠商採取惜售策略因應，NAND Flash後市相對緩和。…… \n查看更多",
          "url": "https://www.facebook.com/ctee.fans/posts/pfbid08KiVGzhtycgNwg9EaL6vyhdQG3VBnokTK8yK31KpPuosf3meRx4264WDVUxDjZMql?__cft__[0]=AZjVqiRvhDyIXKcXvi3Y5SinIHh8jcjw3CNDqCvy4ThfxX1ER8NUtHcU0TMF145Ite_uYwKixlydNUA4itkP2ZjNk-xotx_qZVXP1HmHvDm7nibVG4jQTv_eHzEEbL5BfhqQfJ_I17mcZhH0u0fUKg6Xw5Xy7_lUA-GsJysxSEMHCdlkVlFzV5wxwNM",
          "timestamp": "2026-11-16T02:27:11.179496+00:00",
          "interaction": 67
        },
        {
          "handle": "dnystedt",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Samsung plans to invest US$1.9 billion in its Austin, Texas fab to pave the way for SpaceX satellite chip production at the site, specifically STMicro's STM32V8 microcontroller, an 18nm FD-SOI chip by Starlink, media report. Production is seen starting by 2030. The report cites",
          "url": "https://x.com/dnystedt/status/2122122991509373330",
          "timestamp": "2026-11-16T08:22:02.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 27
        },
        {
          "handle": "dnystedt",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Note: The report has issues. HBM4 supply issues were flagged early this year, and in October, Nvidia cut HBM4 bandwidth specs on its official datasheet to make sure Vera Rubin still began shipping on time.  Actual supply chain earnings calls also tell a slightly different story:",
